  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You curse a creature within range with excruciating pain. The spell’s damage starts at 1d4 Psychic damage, and the target makes a Constitution saving throw. On a failure, it takes the spell’s damage, and the damage die then grows by one size: from 1d4 to 1d6, from 1d6 to 1d8, from 1d8 to 1d10, or from 1d10 to 1d12 (the maximum). On a success, it takes the spell’s damage, and the spell ends. The target repeats the save at the end of each of its turns.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-eNgBEdrePfKZjLLJ\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Each activity is the save with one damage die: use <em>Agony (1d4)</em> when you cast the spell, then the next die after each failed save.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
